        <mxCell id="zone_legend_body" value="• WEB 10.1.100.0/24 (Alp-1) → APP — burst SID 9000030 ✓&#xa;• APP 10.2.100.0/24 (Alp-3) → DB — burst 9000031 ✓ | DROP TABLE 9000033 ✓&#xa;• APP → DB bulk reply (DB→APP &gt;4KB) SID 9000032 ✗  ← reply via SPINE, bypasses IDS&#xa;• APP → {WEB, DB} :22 — cross-tier SSH SID 9000035 ✓&#xa;• DB 10.1.200.0/24 (Alp-2) → outbound exfil SID 9000002 ✓&#xa;• MGT 10.2.50.0/24 (Alp-5) → ANY — audit baseline SID 9000020" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
